WEBVTT

00:06.390 --> 00:08.280
In any classroom, anywhere you go,

00:08.900 --> 00:13.500
you'll probably find people who can 
light up the whole room with their smiles,

00:14.630 --> 00:17.630
I've been wanting to get 
more exercise lately.

00:17.630 --> 00:19.860
and people who are conspicuously alone.

00:17.630 --> 00:19.540
Sounds good. How do you wanna do it?

00:19.540 --> 00:21.670
I dunno... What do you think, Umi?

00:21.670 --> 00:23.700
Beats me.

00:23.700 --> 00:25.670
Oh, how about, like, frisbee?

00:25.670 --> 00:26.880
That's a winner!

00:26.880 --> 00:28.530
Have you ever done it before, Ninacchi?

00:30.970 --> 00:32.930
That's her and me in a nutshell.

00:33.350 --> 00:37.020
HEY, MAEHARA

CAN I COME OVER
TO HANG OUT TODAY?

00:33.350 --> 00:37.020
SURE

00:34.090 --> 00:35.940
This is the story of our secret.

02:08.720 --> 02:10.940
Springtime always gets me down.

02:15.670 --> 02:19.030
So, my name is Yagisawa Miki.

02:19.030 --> 02:22.080
I'll be your class teacher for this year.

02:24.670 --> 02:27.160
A new school year, a new school term.

02:27.450 --> 02:30.020
We've moved past the goodbyes of March

02:30.020 --> 02:32.530
and are now firmly 
in the new meetings of April.

02:33.660 --> 02:36.580
But that's enough about me.

02:36.580 --> 02:39.460
Now I'd like to hear about all of you.

02:40.190 --> 02:41.970
Spring is in the air,

02:41.970 --> 02:45.430
SELF PROFILE

02:42.340 --> 02:44.640
and it always gets me down.

02:45.630 --> 02:50.650
Eeny, meeny, miney, moe...

02:51.630 --> 02:55.320
Okay, here's our leadoff hitter!

02:55.320 --> 02:57.160
Er...

02:58.360 --> 02:59.700
Maehara-kun!

03:00.630 --> 03:03.330
Where are you, Maehara-kun?

03:04.840 --> 03:05.980
That's me.

03:08.020 --> 03:10.500
You're from... Matsubara Middle?

03:10.940 --> 03:13.030
That's not around here, is it?

03:13.850 --> 03:19.190
Next prefecture over. I moved here in the 
winter of my last year of middle school.

03:19.190 --> 03:21.890
Due to family reasons, one could say.

03:21.890 --> 03:24.080
Ah, I more or less get it now.

03:25.010 --> 03:28.470
You put down "gaming" 
under skills and hobbies,

03:28.810 --> 03:31.770
and for your likes... 
"Nothing in particular"?

03:32.270 --> 03:36.260
Do you have anything you look forward to 
on weekends or stuff like that?

03:38.790 --> 03:40.240
I can think of one thing.

03:40.510 --> 03:43.820
Hey, that's just what I'm looking for!

03:43.820 --> 03:44.950
Er...

03:45.600 --> 03:49.670
I have the place to myself on Fridays 
because my mother's out working.

03:49.950 --> 03:53.790
So I order pizza or whatever, 
chug down some cola,

03:53.790 --> 03:57.130
game on the big TV in the living room,

03:57.500 --> 03:59.540
and watch things 
on the computer and stuff.

03:59.980 --> 04:03.040
Huh... Anything else?

04:03.510 --> 04:05.090
Movies, maybe?

04:05.540 --> 04:07.100
Nice!

04:07.100 --> 04:08.970
What kind do you usually watch?

04:09.610 --> 04:13.450
Shark movies, alligator movies...

04:13.450 --> 04:16.570
I like B-grade thrillers like that.

04:16.570 --> 04:20.060
At least, if I had to choose something.

04:20.530 --> 04:22.660
O-Oh...

04:22.980 --> 04:24.660
Sharks and alligators, huh?

04:25.350 --> 04:26.870
Okay, who's next?

04:26.870 --> 04:29.820
Uh, Amami-san?

04:29.820 --> 04:30.950
That's me!

04:38.300 --> 04:43.340
I'm Amami Yuu, written with the kanji 
for heaven, ocean, and dusk!

04:43.340 --> 04:46.620
Sensei! And my classmates!

04:46.620 --> 04:49.770
I'm looking forward 
to a great year together!

04:49.770 --> 04:51.660
Yes, likewise.

04:51.660 --> 04:55.410
So, your hair is especially lovely. 
I'm sure it's made you the envy of many.

04:55.410 --> 04:58.150
Do you mind if I ask about it?

04:58.420 --> 04:59.610
Go ahead!

05:00.100 --> 05:02.710
My grandma's from overseas.

05:02.710 --> 05:05.620
I'm told I look just like her 
when she was younger.

05:05.620 --> 05:08.470
You're from Tachibana 
Girls' Middle School.

05:09.070 --> 05:12.290
Isn't that a unified middle 
and high school?

05:12.690 --> 05:16.420
It is. But after spending the whole time 
with only other girls for company,

05:16.420 --> 05:19.470
we wanted to try out 
co-ed for high school.

05:20.550 --> 05:22.400
Right, Umi?

05:22.400 --> 05:24.720
Don't drag me into this.

05:24.720 --> 05:29.680
Why don't you go ahead and 
introduce yourself next?

05:29.680 --> 05:31.320
That's okay, right?

05:31.320 --> 05:35.010
Sure. Then please go ahead, uh...

05:36.860 --> 05:38.150
Asanagi-san?

05:38.150 --> 05:40.740
Sure, I guess.

05:42.380 --> 05:44.650
I'm Asanagi Umi.

05:44.650 --> 05:47.450
Same middle school as her.

05:49.660 --> 05:52.930
How'd we end up in the same 
high school class, too?

05:52.930 --> 05:59.140
Frankly, I've had enough of her, 
so please look after her in my place.

05:59.140 --> 06:04.390
Hey, Umi, you meanie! You're making me 
sound like an abandoned dog!

06:04.700 --> 06:08.420
Yo, I think this class might be a winner.

06:04.740 --> 06:09.970
Yeah? I guess I'll put down 
"Gentle and calm. Does not bite."

06:08.420 --> 06:11.890
Right? We might just have lucked out.

06:10.230 --> 06:14.910
Forget sounding like one, 
now I'm just straight up a dog!

06:14.830 --> 06:19.860
This class will probably revolve around 
those two for the whole year.

06:15.390 --> 06:18.660
Fine. I'm okay with being a dog. 
Just don't abandon me.

06:20.830 --> 06:24.370
Wait, do you even like dogs?

06:21.160 --> 06:25.370
Not that it has anything at all 
to do with me, of course.

06:24.370 --> 06:25.860
You like them, right?

06:26.200 --> 06:27.920
Right?

06:32.710 --> 06:34.740
Come on, Yuu-chin.

06:35.960 --> 06:37.440
And so,

06:37.440 --> 06:40.940
having made the worst possible first 
impression like it was second nature,

06:40.940 --> 06:45.380
I was sentenced to a life 
of solitude in high school, too.

06:52.350 --> 06:54.600
I went straight to school 
and back every day,

06:54.600 --> 06:57.060
and I spent my days off entirely at home.

06:57.460 --> 07:00.020
It was all the same old, same old.

07:05.660 --> 07:07.990
I'm used to being by myself.

07:07.990 --> 07:11.680
That doesn't mean 
I like being alone, though.

07:12.120 --> 07:16.100
I'd be okay with yakking it up 
with friends after school and stuff.

07:16.900 --> 07:20.040
In fact, there was a time when 
I longed for something like that.

07:23.840 --> 07:27.570
I can get by surprisingly well 
even without friends.

07:31.720 --> 07:34.810
Finally, one more week down!

07:35.350 --> 07:41.980
I only nodded off a few times in the 
last two periods. Umi, praise me.

07:41.980 --> 07:44.230
"Only nodded off" 
means you still nodded off!

07:44.230 --> 07:47.320
If you want praise, 
try to stay awake the whole time.

07:48.540 --> 07:51.280
Don't you think you might be asking 
for too much there?

07:51.280 --> 07:55.380
I was already in a food coma from lunch, 
and then came the Buddhist chanting!

07:55.380 --> 07:58.460
How could anyone withstand 
that psychological warfare?

07:55.560 --> 07:58.460
Amami-san's always so angelic.

07:58.460 --> 08:02.330
That "Buddhist chanting" was ethics class.

08:01.820 --> 08:06.170
That smile of hers will get me through 
any class, no matter how boring.

08:03.390 --> 08:07.950
It's Friday, Umi. 
Let's go do something after this.

08:06.170 --> 08:08.430
Asanagi's not bad either.

08:07.950 --> 08:10.720
Arcade, karaoke, anything goes.

08:08.430 --> 08:11.470
Heck, she's pretty damn hot herself.

08:10.720 --> 08:14.640
Oh, sorry, Yuu. I'm going 
to have to refuse today.

08:11.470 --> 08:16.010
But anyone'd come out badly 
when compared with Amami-san.

08:14.640 --> 08:16.010
Wait, why?

08:16.010 --> 08:17.180
Do you have plans?

08:17.600 --> 08:20.580
Uh, yeah, something like that.

08:21.220 --> 08:24.690
There's this movie 
I've been wanting to watch.

08:24.690 --> 08:27.460
Yeah? What kind?

08:27.460 --> 08:29.370
Action? Romance?

08:29.370 --> 08:32.480
If it's something good, 
I'd like to see it, too.

08:32.480 --> 08:34.160
Uh...

08:35.000 --> 08:36.440
It's this thing.

08:38.780 --> 08:41.780
I saw that reaction coming 
from a mile away.

08:41.780 --> 08:43.590
Oh, don't get me wrong!

08:43.590 --> 08:48.220
I wasn't trying to look down 
on your taste or anything!

08:48.220 --> 08:51.470
But you thought it looked boring, 
didn't you?

08:51.820 --> 08:55.050
Well, um, yeah. I guess.

08:55.680 --> 09:01.070
It's fine. I knew you would, which is why 
I was gonna watch it by myself.

09:01.070 --> 09:04.400
I-I'll watch it with you! 
Where can I stream it?

09:04.400 --> 09:07.610
It's not on any streaming sites. 
It's a real niche flick.

09:08.130 --> 09:10.830
So sorry, but you're going 
to have to let me go today.

09:10.830 --> 09:12.680
I'm free tomorrow,

09:12.680 --> 09:14.280
so I'll make it up to you then.

09:16.240 --> 09:20.580
Okay, but you'd better promise! 
Tomorrow or bust, okay?

09:20.580 --> 09:22.670
Yeah, I promise.

09:23.990 --> 09:27.330
I don't think there's anything 
wrong with her taste.

09:31.470 --> 09:33.620
Is the new one good?

09:33.620 --> 09:35.480
It's got a gentle, deep flavor.

09:37.650 --> 09:39.560
Friends, huh?

09:40.110 --> 09:43.120
Wait, quit getting all melancholic.

09:48.850 --> 09:51.190
I haven't been here in a month,

09:51.190 --> 09:54.660
but there's no beating the feel 
of a real video store.

09:59.460 --> 10:00.700
Hmm...

10:01.470 --> 10:05.920
New releases are all well and good, 
but I think I'll go with a classic today.

10:07.380 --> 10:10.220
Sorry! I was so busy choosing, 
I didn't see you!

10:10.220 --> 10:11.010
Sheesh.

10:11.410 --> 10:15.430
I've been right next to you for a while, 
but you didn't notice at all.

10:17.310 --> 10:20.020
That's not nice, Maehara-kun.

10:20.900 --> 10:23.230
Asanagi-san?

10:24.470 --> 10:26.920
Yep, bingo.

10:26.920 --> 10:31.070
We're classmates, but this is our 
first time talking one-on-one, huh?

10:31.070 --> 10:34.280
Oh, yeah. That's true.

10:35.610 --> 10:39.280
Wait, didn't you say you had plans today?

10:40.950 --> 10:42.420
Oho?

10:43.260 --> 10:48.990
What's this, Maehara-kun? Were you 
listening in on Yuu and me earlier?

10:49.500 --> 10:53.980
Look at you eavesdropping. You bad boy.

10:53.980 --> 10:55.720
Wait, no...

10:56.070 --> 10:57.010
Sorry.

10:58.800 --> 11:03.140
Relax. We were going full volume 
in the middle of the classroom.

11:03.140 --> 11:05.310
Anybody and their mother could hear it.

11:06.570 --> 11:09.400
I'm the one who should be 
apologizing for my best friend.

11:09.400 --> 11:13.130
Nah, that was definitely my bad.

11:13.130 --> 11:19.320
You know, what I told Yuu 
was half-truth, half-lie.

11:19.790 --> 11:22.220
My actual goal for today was...

11:22.220 --> 11:24.790
Huh? M-Me?

11:24.790 --> 11:26.040
Yep.

11:26.040 --> 11:29.250
Me. Need to talk. With you.

11:29.250 --> 11:30.700
Okay?

11:30.700 --> 11:32.890
Uh, okay?

11:32.890 --> 11:37.000
I had to work up the courage too, y'know.

11:37.380 --> 11:38.550
Here, have a look.

11:39.730 --> 11:41.280
Wait, no way!

11:44.350 --> 11:45.680
Wait, no way!

11:45.680 --> 11:56.150
NAME: ASANAGI UMI
FORMER MIDDLE SCHOOL: TACHIBANA GIRLS'
HOBBIES: MOVIES, GAMES, BOOKS—
ANYTHING INDOOR. B MOVIES ARE MY FAVORITE.

11:45.680 --> 11:50.470
"Likes: I love cola and other 
carbonated beverages to death."

11:50.470 --> 11:53.680
"Comment: I have found 
myself a kindred spirit."

11:53.680 --> 11:56.150
"I'd be very happy if we could be friends."

11:56.150 --> 11:57.560
"Or something."

11:57.900 --> 12:01.400
This isn't what I wrote 
on the first day of school,

12:01.870 --> 12:04.200
but when I put pen to paper, 
this is what I got.

12:04.780 --> 12:08.170
If I put all of myself out there 
like you did, anyway.

12:08.170 --> 12:10.230
I see now.

12:10.230 --> 12:12.540
So, what do you recommend?

12:12.540 --> 12:15.480
I'm still a beginner with this genre.

12:15.480 --> 12:20.680
Ever since your self-intro, I've been 
wanting you to tell me all about it.

12:20.680 --> 12:23.640
Uh, let's see...

12:23.640 --> 12:26.920
If you don't mind me picking 
by personal taste alone...

12:28.480 --> 12:30.340
Something like this, maybe?

12:31.810 --> 12:36.190
The heck is a piranha shark? 
What's the point of shrinking them?

12:36.190 --> 12:39.440
Just call them man-eating
 piranhas at that point.

12:39.440 --> 12:42.720
And this look of horror 
on the cover is surreal, too.

12:42.720 --> 12:43.620
Right?

12:44.040 --> 12:47.760
An attempt was made to look innovative, 
and I respect that if nothing else.

12:47.760 --> 12:50.790
Kinda reminds me of 
Kung-Fu Shark, you know?

12:50.790 --> 12:53.960
Hey, I know that one. It's good.

12:54.250 --> 12:55.840
Yeah, so bad it's good.

12:56.980 --> 12:58.260
Exactly.

12:59.030 --> 13:04.280
And that was how, unbeknownst to anyone, 
my friendship with Asanagi-san began.

13:03.320 --> 13:06.190
I've been wanting to get 
more exercise lately.

13:06.190 --> 13:08.020
Sounds good. How do you wanna do it?

13:08.020 --> 13:10.450
I dunno... What do you think, Umi?

13:10.450 --> 13:12.860
Beats me.

13:12.860 --> 13:14.060
Oh, how about, like, frisbee?

13:14.060 --> 13:15.530
That's a winner!

13:15.530 --> 13:17.300
Have you ever done it before, Ninacchi?

13:17.300 --> 13:19.030
Maybe not, actually.

13:19.030 --> 13:21.990
HEY, MAEHARA

CAN I COME OVER
TO HANG OUT TODAY?

13:19.030 --> 13:21.990
SURE

13:20.560 --> 13:21.990
Heya, Maehara.

13:22.360 --> 13:23.890
H-Heya.

13:24.320 --> 13:29.170
I already ordered food. 
Are you good with sharing?

13:29.170 --> 13:34.270
Yeah. We more or less have the same taste.

13:34.750 --> 13:36.040
By the way...

13:36.420 --> 13:37.590
What did you order?

13:37.590 --> 13:41.600
Well, we got something 
on the blander side last time,

13:41.600 --> 13:44.050
so I went all-in on the flavor today.

13:44.380 --> 13:48.260
Angel & Devil 
Garlic'n'Cheese'n'Teriyaki Chicken.

13:48.260 --> 13:53.190
Double the cheese, mayo, and toppings, 
and triple the garlic.

13:55.940 --> 13:58.440
You know what's up, Maehara!

13:59.990 --> 14:03.070
Anyway, good job getting 
through another week!

14:08.900 --> 14:10.790
So, what are we playing today?

14:10.790 --> 14:13.120
Mat farming in 'Hunter again?

14:14.080 --> 14:16.740
That doesn't sound bad at all,

14:16.740 --> 14:20.010
but I'm in the mood for some PvP today.

14:20.010 --> 14:24.160
Oh, that thing? You dare challenge me?

14:24.160 --> 14:30.100
I'll pump your ass full of lead 
until you've got a second butthole!

14:30.360 --> 14:33.350
Says the girl who lost 0-10 last week.

14:33.350 --> 14:36.560
I-I put in the work at home, okay?

14:37.000 --> 14:40.110
And I'll even the score today, 
so lay off of me.

14:40.110 --> 14:41.280
Whatever you say.

14:57.350 --> 14:58.600
Stop, Asanagi-san!

14:59.270 --> 15:04.300
Don't slam the ground in gamer rage. 
The downstairs neighbors will hear.

15:04.300 --> 15:05.790
Different one.

15:05.790 --> 15:06.430
Huh?

15:06.430 --> 15:08.090
Let's play a different game!

15:12.480 --> 15:14.670
Whoa, look at the time.

15:15.020 --> 15:17.120
I should get going soon.

15:17.120 --> 15:19.110
Okay, let's call it a night.

15:19.110 --> 15:20.040
Yep.

15:21.220 --> 15:23.850
Oh, let me help clean up.

15:23.850 --> 15:26.800
It's fine. There's nothing 
to wash other than the glasses.

15:31.390 --> 15:36.010
What's up, Maehara? 
Why are you admiring my bod?

15:36.010 --> 15:36.670
Huh?

15:39.190 --> 15:40.090
You sleaze.

15:40.090 --> 15:41.990
Uh, it's just...

15:41.990 --> 15:46.270
I was curious how you're so slim 
when you're just as big an eater as me.

15:47.610 --> 15:49.840
I do get a bunch of exercise.

15:50.240 --> 15:54.350
And I'm not that slim, really. 
You're the one who's getting plump.

15:54.350 --> 15:54.930
En garde!

16:00.150 --> 16:01.650
Take this!

16:02.830 --> 16:07.000
Aha, so that's your weak point, Maehara!

16:05.290 --> 16:07.000
No! Stop!

16:08.820 --> 16:16.040
Hmm, I am a bit stressed out 
after you whooped my ass today.

16:16.040 --> 16:18.360
Please stop!

16:18.360 --> 16:21.830
Ooh, nice wailing for a boy.

16:23.060 --> 16:25.960
Man, I had lotsa fun today as well.

16:26.550 --> 16:29.720
This is only the third time 
we've hung out.

16:29.720 --> 16:33.180
Who'd have thought we'd get along so well?

16:33.180 --> 16:34.850
There's only one reason for that.

16:35.280 --> 16:37.170
I know we have similar tastes and all,

16:37.170 --> 16:40.980
but you're a weird one for 
actually talking to me about it.

16:40.980 --> 16:46.720
Not as weird as a certain Maehara-kun 
who brought a girl home right off the bat.

16:47.030 --> 16:49.250
C-Can you blame me?

16:49.250 --> 16:52.390
All I could think of for us to do 
was play video games at home!

16:52.390 --> 16:53.450
Yeah?

16:53.450 --> 16:55.330
That makes sense.

16:55.660 --> 16:58.910
Okay, so we're going out next week.

16:59.760 --> 17:00.610
Sure.

17:02.300 --> 17:02.960
Wha?

17:03.670 --> 17:05.590
Wait, timeout!

17:05.590 --> 17:06.840
What?

17:06.840 --> 17:09.380
Are you busy next week or something?

17:09.380 --> 17:12.140
Not that! The next part!

17:12.140 --> 17:13.460
Going out?

17:13.460 --> 17:15.700
That! By out...

17:15.700 --> 17:19.000
you mean outside, don't you? 
The great, wide outdoors?

17:19.000 --> 17:20.930
What else would I mean?

17:20.930 --> 17:24.060
You gotta be high schooler and 
hit the town now and then.

17:24.430 --> 17:27.940
We could do a little 
shopping, eat outside,

17:27.940 --> 17:29.780
and go to an arcade or whatever.

17:29.780 --> 17:33.190
I feel bad just coming over all the time,

17:33.190 --> 17:37.420
so I thought it'd be prudent to coach you 
on how to have fun outside.

17:37.420 --> 17:40.220
Uh, just so we're on the same page...

17:40.220 --> 17:43.250
You mean we're going out 
together, just the two of us?

17:43.250 --> 17:45.000
But of course!

17:45.000 --> 17:49.090
We haven't told anyone 
in class that we're friends.

17:49.710 --> 17:52.440
That's something we'd agreed on 
after talking it out.

17:53.130 --> 17:57.250
I'm part of the class furniture, 
whereas Asanagi-san is its beating heart.

17:57.750 --> 18:02.400
If people found out we were hanging out, 
it might cause a bunch of chatter.

18:02.980 --> 18:04.580
Ah, I see.

18:04.580 --> 18:08.340
Has the prospect of an after-school 
date with me got you nervous?

18:08.340 --> 18:09.860
"Date"?

18:09.860 --> 18:12.880
No, that's not really it.

18:13.860 --> 18:15.350
It'll be fine.

18:15.350 --> 18:18.700
I'll make sure we don't get found out, 
even if we do run into any classmates.

18:20.100 --> 18:24.360
You're a strapping young lad. 
Experience some thrill in life for once.

18:24.360 --> 18:26.710
Is this really okay?

18:26.710 --> 18:30.230
I'm telling you it is. 
What more do you need?

18:30.230 --> 18:34.780
And meh, even if someone finds out, 
we can just admit we're dating.

18:34.780 --> 18:38.180
"Me and her..." "He and I..." 
"...are dating!"

18:38.900 --> 18:42.440
But we're not, though.

18:42.900 --> 18:44.390
I'm just kidding.

18:44.700 --> 18:47.960
Anyway, that's the plan for next week.

18:51.230 --> 18:56.200
That's weird. Did I hear my son wrong?

18:56.580 --> 18:59.170
Would you mind telling me 
one more time, just in case?

18:59.780 --> 19:01.210
Again...

19:01.210 --> 19:06.290
I'm going out with a friend 
after class next Friday.

19:07.340 --> 19:14.170
So I'd like a little more allowance...

19:14.580 --> 19:19.630
You're not being bullied 
for money or anything, are you?!

19:19.630 --> 19:22.310
I'm not. This is a friend.

19:22.720 --> 19:24.940
And not an imaginary one?

19:24.940 --> 19:25.810
Not.

19:25.810 --> 19:29.560
Oh, so you finally made a friend!

19:29.560 --> 19:32.530
You want more money? You've got it!

19:32.530 --> 19:33.650
Here you go.

19:34.340 --> 19:36.620
Wait, I don't need that much!

19:36.620 --> 19:39.500
I can make do with a couple thousand yen!

19:39.500 --> 19:43.990
Really? But if you need more, 
just let me know, okay?

19:45.390 --> 19:47.790
I'm happy for you, Maki.

19:49.030 --> 19:49.840
Thanks.

19:50.340 --> 19:51.750
WENT WITH SALT'N'SEAWEED

19:51.750 --> 19:56.260
GOOD MORNING, ASA...
DO YOU HAVE A SEC?

19:52.710 --> 19:56.260
MAEHARA

19:53.090 --> 19:54.960
Good morning, Asanagi-san.

19:54.960 --> 19:56.260
Do you have a sec?

19:56.470 --> 19:58.130
MM, MORNING.

19:58.420 --> 20:00.470
Mm, morning.

20:00.760 --> 20:02.860
Did you get your money?

20:02.860 --> 20:03.800
Yep.

20:03.800 --> 20:06.940
Yay! Thanks for treating me!

20:06.940 --> 20:09.300
Yeah, no. We're splitting it 
down the middle.

20:09.300 --> 20:11.800
Anyway, I'll ping you later.

20:11.800 --> 20:13.650
See you at school!

20:13.650 --> 20:14.490
Sure.

20:17.470 --> 20:19.780
Yuu-chin, did you 
watch last night's episode?

20:19.780 --> 20:21.290
I sure did.

20:21.290 --> 20:24.950
The protag was so good in that scene.

20:24.950 --> 20:28.600
Sorry, couldn't catch it live last night.

20:28.600 --> 20:30.080
Yeah?

20:30.080 --> 20:32.040
I was looking some stuff up.

20:32.040 --> 20:34.050
By the time I realized, I'd missed it.

20:35.300 --> 20:37.550
Did you do something just now, Umi?

20:37.550 --> 20:39.030
Er...

20:39.030 --> 20:43.350
Just scratched an itch on my back. 
A bug might've gotten me.

20:56.290 --> 21:01.600
Am I actually being a good friend 
to Asanagi-san?

21:03.330 --> 21:06.200
So, what is it, Senpai?

21:06.200 --> 21:08.050
What'd you want to talk about?

21:08.050 --> 21:11.520
Well, I've been meaning 
to tell you something.

21:11.960 --> 21:16.250
Y-Yikes! He's gonna ask her out, isn't he?

21:16.250 --> 21:18.510
Come on. Over here.

21:19.050 --> 21:20.610
Wait for me!

21:22.430 --> 21:23.300
Ow...

21:23.300 --> 21:26.480
Hey, keep it down. They'll find us.

21:26.480 --> 21:28.300
S-Sorry.

21:29.100 --> 21:32.020
Huh? Maehara-kun?

21:32.020 --> 21:33.760
Amami-san?

21:33.760 --> 21:35.510
Wait, what?

21:35.510 --> 21:37.730
Do you know this guy, Yuu-chin?

21:37.730 --> 21:40.220
What are you saying, Ninacchi?

21:40.220 --> 21:42.980
Do I know him? He's in our class.

21:42.980 --> 21:44.560
Maehara Maki-kun.

21:44.950 --> 21:46.370
Either way...

21:46.660 --> 21:48.220
Could you let us through?

21:48.220 --> 21:51.170
We can't spy on Asanagi 
with you blocking the way.

21:51.170 --> 21:52.020
Asanagi?

21:52.020 --> 21:53.780
Come on, Yuu-chin, over here.

21:53.780 --> 21:55.560
U-Um, I...

21:57.480 --> 21:58.730
Asanagi-chan.

22:00.230 --> 22:03.760
Would you please go out with me?

22:08.130 --> 22:11.720
Translation: Sriram Gurunathan

22:21.560 --> 22:24.650
Subtitle Editing: Geoff Mazzolini

Subtitle Timing: Krzysztof Kunc

22:24.940 --> 22:27.900
Quality Check: Ashley Barboza

Translation Check: David Saylor

23:38.660 --> 23:40.980
"Asanagi Umi and Amami Yuu."
